OL,3,GNEWSAJagtar Singh Johal granted bail
OL,4,Anine years after being detained in
OL,5,AIndia
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Scottish Sikh activist who has been
OL,8,Flocked up in India for almost nine
OL,9,Fyears without conviction has been
OL,10,Fgranted bail.
OL,12,FJagtar Singh Johal, from Dumbarton, was
OL,13,Farrested and detained in 2017 in
OL,14,Fconnection with alleged terror
OL,15,Foffences.
OL,17,FThe Indian authorities have accused him
OL,18,Fof having a role in a series of
OL,19,Ftargeted killings of religious and
OL,20,Fpolitical figures.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
